# Instruction fetch from PSRAM, bench env only (gm-2cl.20).
#
# Copies .flash.text (3.0 MB) into PSRAM at boot so instruction cache misses
# are served by octal PSRAM instead of quad flash. Measured 2026-09-08 on the
# bench board on top of QIO: the small-widget draw went from 2.1 to 1.3 ms and
# every page-change draw 20 to 45 percent faster (standby 36.5, brew 27.7,
# new_profile 121.1, info 68.8 ms), with PSRAM free falling from 4.55 MB to
# 1.55 MB with the animation resident. The owner decided on 2026-09-09 to
# leave production off and keep this behind the display-loadtest-xip env so
# it can be measured further. rodata (2.1 MB) does not fit on top, so
# SPIRAM_RODATA stays off. Chained last for that env only.
CONFIG_SPIRAM_FETCH_INSTRUCTIONS=y
